% WEKA ARFF Dataset: Smart Energy Consumption Analytics
% Course: Data Mining and Warehousing Lab (24B15CS313), JIIT Noida
% Notice: energy_kwh is isolated to ensure Zero Data Leakage.

@relation energy_consumption_train

@attribute hour numeric
@attribute day_of_week numeric
@attribute month numeric
@attribute quarter numeric
@attribute is_weekend {0,1}
@attribute is_peak_hour {0,1}
